{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07004","headline":"经杀子谷 · 陶翰","name":"经杀子谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扶苏秦帝子，举代称其贤。\n百万犹在握，可争天下权。\n束身就一劒，壮志皆弃捐。\n塞下有遗迹，千龄人共传。\n疎芜尽荒草，寂历空寒烟。\n到此尽垂泪，非我独潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}